{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56050","headline":"寄勉二三子 · 齐己","name":"寄勉二三子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不见二三子，悠然吴楚间。\n尽应生白发，几个在青山。\n暇日还宜爱，余生莫放闲。\n君闻国风否？千载咏关关。\n（同前）（按：《全唐诗》卷八三八收此诗缺七字，今重录。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56050.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56050","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}